## Program Outcome

Tool Shed provides one standard, deterministic Project Executive View at `work/100k.md`. It gives
the operator a concise project-world review, controlled attention and change signals, recommended
next cycles, and an exhaustive accountability ledger from the released canonical projection. The
view is read-only, refreshable, checkable, portable across file and SQLite authority, and proven on
the exact configured Work2 development targets.

